{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"哈巴谷书","commonName":"哈巴谷书","title":"哈巴谷书","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"79e455564c8db5af84e1090faf367e2f580c93a71dbc68109fd4b0c698e35a0b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我要登上瞭望台，",{"text":"站在望楼上守候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看耶和华要对我说什么，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要怎样向祂分诉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的答复"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和华对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“将我的启示记下来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清楚地刻在板上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便于人们阅读。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这启示还未到实现之时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它关乎结局，没有虚假。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使缓慢，也要等候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这事终必发生，不再迟延。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看那骄傲之人，他们心术不正，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但义人必靠信心","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"而活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"财富","poem":1},{"noteId":2},{"text":"会欺骗骄傲之人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们永不安分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像阴间一样贪得无厌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如死亡一般永不满足。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他们征服万国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掳掠万民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“但万国万民必用诗歌和俗语嘲讽他们，说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘你们有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们吞没别人的财产，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"靠剥削别人囤积财富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要到何时呢？’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的债主必突然行动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你们战战兢兢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沦为他们的俘虏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们从前掳掠许多国家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杀人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毁他们的土地、城市和人民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以各国的余民必掠夺你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“为自己的家积蓄不义之财、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在高处搭窝躲避灾祸的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们阴谋毁灭各族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致自辱己家，自害己命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"墙上的石头必高声控诉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房子的梁木必同声响应。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“以人血建城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以罪恶造城池的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦的劳碌都化为灰烬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国的辛劳尽是虚空。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这不都是出于万军之耶和华吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为大地必充满对耶和华之荣耀的认识，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同海洋被水充满。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"“让邻居喝酒直到灌醉他们，好观看他们祼体的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必饱受羞辱，毫无荣耀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们喝吧，露出下体吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华右手中的杯将传给你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的荣耀将变成羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们以暴虐对待黎巴嫩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己必被暴虐吞噬；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们毁灭野兽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己必被恐怖笼罩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们杀人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毁土地、城市和人民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"“雕刻的偶像有什么益处？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骗人的铸像有什么用处？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"制造者竟信靠自己造的哑巴偶像！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对木头说‘醒醒吧’，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对哑巴石头说‘起来吧’的人啊，你们有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们能教导你们吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，它们外面包金裹银，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"里面却毫无生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华住在祂的圣殿中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人都要在祂面前肃静。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“信心”或译“忠信”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":4}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"“财富”参照死海古卷，多个希伯来抄本为“酒”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}